Source: pg-relation-sql
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~)
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/asmgit/pg_relation_sql

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-pg-relation-sql
Architecture: all
Provides: postgresql-pg-relation-sql
Depends: postgresql-PGVERSION, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Navigate PostgreSQL foreign-key relations through generated SQL functions
 pg_relation_sql turns every foreign key into lookup and list functions for
 navigating declared relations. Upstream intentionally ships a standalone SQL
 script rather than a CREATE EXTENSION package.
